                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>确认已复制的内容正是准备运行的文本，依赖也一并到位。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 510, height: 116, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
